// chriz-iwd-encounters 310: a yuan-ti mage that Yxunomei's temple calls in comes for
// the party. It sits in the mage's override slot, so it runs before the mage's
// other scripts (SCS's mage AI ends with a block that holds every idle mage).
// The first pass only marks the mage, so on that pass the base game's difficulty
// check (EFDELDEF: below Hard a mage that sees no party member leaves) still decides
// whether the mage stays.

IF
  Global("CIE_YXU_PURSUE","LOCALS",0)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobal("CIE_YXU_PURSUE","LOCALS",1)
    Continue()
END

IF
  Global("CIE_YXU_PURSUE","LOCALS",1)
  ActionListEmpty()
  !Detect(NearestEnemyOf(Myself))
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    MoveToObject(Player1)
END
